  "question": {
    "text": "A police car moving at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, chases a motorcyclist. The policeman sounds his horn at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>180</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>, while both of them move towards a stationary siren of frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>160</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>. If it is given that the motorcyclist does not observe any beats then, calculate the speed (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)&nbsp;of the motorcyclist round off to two decimal places? [speed of sound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "35.02",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Speed of sound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/zkgbuwdehyyouqpcnjgyitlvelhkjrizknqeagtvwglacbymjb.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br />Case (i),<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> ... (i)<br /><br />Case (ii), <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>330</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> ... (ii)<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> There are no beats<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mn>180</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>330</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>9</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mn>32670</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>99</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26400</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>80</mn><mi>u</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6270</mn><mn>179</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>35.02</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
